# KAPLAY Animation Reference

## Sources of animation

- Sprite sheet animations (`anims` in `loadSprite`).
- Transform-based animation/tweens.
- Procedural updates (`onUpdate` with time-based movement).

## Rules of thumb

- Keep animation names behavior-oriented (`walk-up`, `idle-right`) not art-oriented.
- Trigger transitions from state changes, not every frame.
- Ensure idle animation fallback for each movement direction.

## Stability patterns

- Only call `play()` when animation actually changes.
- Avoid restarting the same loop every frame.
- Use explicit direction state tracking to prevent jitter.
